flowchart LR
    P0("<span class='pid'>1.1</span>Register"):::proc
    Visitor0[Visitor]
    Visitor0 -->|name, email,<br/>password, rooms| P0
    P0 -->|check your inbox| Visitor0
    D10["<span class='sid'>D1</span>Users"]:::store
    D10 -->|existing user| P0
    P0 -->|user, hashed password,<br/>hashed code| D10
    Email0[Email service]
    P0 -->|six digit code| Email0
    P1("<span class='pid'>1.2</span>Verify email"):::proc
    Visitor1[Visitor]
    Visitor1 -->|email, code| P1
    Member1[Member]
    P1 -->|login cookie| Member1
    D11["<span class='sid'>D1</span>Users"]:::store
    D11 -->|hashed code, expiry| P1
    P1 -->|email confirmed| D11
    Email1[Email service]
    P1 -->|fresh code| Email1
    P2("<span class='pid'>1.3</span>Log in"):::proc
    Member2[Member]
    Member2 -->|email, password| P2
    P2 -->|login cookie, user| Member2
    D12["<span class='sid'>D1</span>Users"]:::store
    D12 -->|user record| P2
    Email2[Email service]
    P2 -->|fresh code when<br/>not confirmed| Email2
    P3("<span class='pid'>1.4</span>Reset<br/>password"):::proc
    Member3[Member]
    Member3 -->|email, code,<br/>new password| P3
    P3 -->|same answer,<br/>all done| Member3
    D13["<span class='sid'>D1</span>Users"]:::store
    D13 -->|user, hashed code| P3
    P3 -->|reset code,<br/>new hash| D13
    Email3[Email service]
    P3 -->|reset code| Email3
